# Tamisa needs no environment variables.
# OWL-ViT runs in the browser through Transformers.js and downloads its weights from
# the public Hugging Face hub with no key. Bags are stored in the browser
# (sessionStorage for the bag in progress, localStorage for saved bags).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_FILES is set automatically by next.config.ts at build time; do not set it here.
